diff --git a/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..486f358
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+:command:`pysemver` subcommands now accept an optional leading ``v`` or ``V``
+on version arguments (for example a git tag like ``v1.4.2``). Output is
+printed without the prefix.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..a560a17
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Deprecate passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`semver.version.Version.compare`.
+A :class:`DeprecationWarning` is now emitted; use a ``Version`` instance,
+``str``, ``tuple`` or ``list`` instead.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..eee1a2d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Rename the ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`semver.version.Version.next_version`
+to ``token``, matching ``bump_prerelease`` and ``bump_build``. Passing
+``prerelease_token`` still works but emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`.
